    "title": "Juvenile arrested on dirt bike charges in Lawrence - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Daniel Duric ,\n5 hours ago LAWRENCE, MA — Members of the Detective and Patrol Divisions arrested a juvenile operating a dirt bike in the vicinity of Essex Street and Amesbury Street on Tuesday. The dirt bike, intended solely for off-road use, was outfitted with studded tires and lacked essential safety equipment such as headlights, brake lights, and turn signals. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
